@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@superAdminToken = REPLACE_WITH_SUPERADMIN_TOKEN
@headCoachToken = REPLACE_WITH_HEAD_COACH_TOKEN
@teamId = 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555
@gameId = aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee

### Global controls: SuperAdmin only
GET {{baseUrl}}/email/automation
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Read-only automated email tracking log; Central calendar date, 100 entries per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/email/automation/log?date=2026-11-11&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Invalid calendar date returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/email/automation/log?date=2026-02-30
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Log requires authentication (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/email/automation/log

### Non-SuperAdmin log request returns 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/email/automation/log?date=2026-11-11
Authorization: Bearer {{headCoachToken}}

### All automations off; manual invitations remain available
PUT {{baseUrl}}/email/automation
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "automaticInvitations": false,
  "rosterReminders": false,
  "lineupReminders": false
}

### Head coach of a managed home game: private GM code, otherwise code:null
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/games/{{gameId}}/teams/{{teamId}}/game-manager-access
Authorization: Bearer {{headCoachToken}}

### Unauthenticated requests must return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/games/{{gameId}}/teams/{{teamId}}/game-manager-access
